# Structural gate: the flat-materialised array must have exactly ONE driver
# per bit.  Before the fix the element-0 write drove the alias wire
# \gpio_t[0] against the flip-flop's whole-array update (DAT conflicting
# drivers), which also makes the SAT miter pass VACUOUSLY -- so `check` is the
# discriminating test here, not the miter.
read_uhdm slpp_all/surelog.uhdm
hierarchy -check -top unpacked_array_slice_shift_ff
proc; opt_clean
check -assert
